        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-08T21:52:42.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Just a couple of my pics of Sentinels costumes from GenCon.  I know beevolant has more on her camera whenever she gets a chance to upload them.<br>\nI’m too lazy to figure out embedding, and don’t want to slow down anyone who uses their phone to access stuff with a bunch of images, so have some links to my twitpics!</p><aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://dfo9svwruwoho.cloudfront.net/images/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n      <a href=\"http://twitpic.com/631cdl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">twitpic.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:600/338;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/e/e8866cd14841ce5fa37a03b079e4132a1db9f44c.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"http://twitpic.com/631cdl\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tachyon (me!), The Wraith (@beevolant), and Tempest facing off with Citizen...</a></h3>\n\n<p>Tachyon (me!), The Wraith (@beevolant), and Tempest facing off with Citizen Dawn at Gen Con!  @sentinelsotm</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://dfo9svwruwoho.cloudfront.net/images/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n      <a href=\"http://twitpic.com/631dwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">twitpic.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:600/448;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/c/c8c38a813f9a75ef0488c62b25849dacf63a4b8f.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"600\" height=\"448\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"http://twitpic.com/631dwo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Tempest is down!  @sentinelsotm</a></h3>\n\n<p>Tempest is down!  @sentinelsotm</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<aside class=\"onebox allowlistedgeneric\">\n  <header class=\"source\">\n      <img src=\"https://dfo9svwruwoho.cloudfront.net/images/favicon.ico\" class=\"site-icon\" width=\"\" height=\"\">\n      <a href=\"http://twitpic.com/633sfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">twitpic.com</a>\n  </header>\n  <article class=\"onebox-body\">\n    <div class=\"aspect-image\" style=\"--aspect-ratio:600/338;\"><img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/d/d7ad34bdfbca5758a0a7cb8619caa127446dceec.jpeg\" class=\"thumbnail\" width=\"600\" height=\"338\"></div>\n\n<h3><a href=\"http://twitpic.com/633sfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">They're not near as fast as I am, but those Scouts sure do try!  @sentinelsotm</a></h3>\n\n<p>They're not near as fast as I am, but those Scouts sure do try!  @sentinelsotm</p>\n\n\n  </article>\n  <div class=\"onebox-metadata\">\n    \n    \n  </div>\n  <div style=\"clear: both\"></div>\n</aside>\n<p>\n(I saw a TF2 group and couldn’t resist grabbing some Scouts to go with our own speedster! ^_^)</p>\n<p>Anyone else have Sentinels pics?  I’d love to see shots of other costumes and Gen Con fun too, but we should probably put those in an Off Topic thread since it’s not really game related.</p>",
