        "raw": "Just a couple of my pics of Sentinels costumes from GenCon.  I know beevolant has more on her camera whenever she gets a chance to upload them. \nI'm too lazy to figure out embedding, and don't want to slow down anyone who uses their phone to access stuff with a bunch of images, so have some links to my twitpics!\nhttp://twitpic.com/631cdl\nhttp://twitpic.com/631dwo\nhttp://twitpic.com/633sfo\n(I saw a TF2 group and couldn't resist grabbing some Scouts to go with our own speedster! ^_^)\n\nAnyone else have Sentinels pics?  I'd love to see shots of other costumes and Gen Con fun too, but we should probably put those in an Off Topic thread since it's not really game related.",
