        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/85f322/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-08-09T16:22:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<blockquote>\n<p>The shoes for Tachyon are perfect? Did you just happen to have those or did you have to go searching for them?</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>I looked for red and white running shoes, but they were all ridiculously expensive and none of them were quite what I wanted anyway, so I bought super cheap white running shoes with a detail pattern I liked and painted those sections red.<br>\nHere’s a close up from when I was working on them, if anyone cares: <a href=\"http://twitpic.com/60pa94&amp;nbsp\" class=\"inline-onebox\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\">Twitpic</a>; You can see where I just used the existing detail as the guide for where to paint.  I’m pretty darn please with how they turned out.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
